flowchart TD
    Start[Alert received from bank TMS] --> A1[Evidence Gathering Agent]
    A1 -->|Structured evidence bundle| A2[Pattern Matching Agent]
    A2 -->|Matched typology + rationale| A3[Case and Narrative Agent]
    A3 -->|Risk score + draft narrative + STR-F fields| Gate{Confidence check}
    Gate -->|High confidence match| Human[Human checkpoint: analyst review]
    Gate -->|Low/ambiguous confidence| Human
    Human -->|Accept| Accept[Disposition recorded]
    Human -->|Edit| Edit[Officer edits narrative/typology]
    Human -->|Override| Override[Mandatory override reason logged]
    Edit --> Accept
    Override --> Accept
    Accept --> Log[Agent Activity Log: full reasoning chain persisted]
    Log --> Sample{Random sampling draw}
    Sample -->|Selected| Review[Secondary human re-review]
    Sample -->|Not selected| Feed[Feedback aggregator]
    Review --> Feed
    Feed --> Drift[Drift and agreement-rate metrics]
    Drift --> Rules[Typology and Rules Console: retuning]
    Drift --> Gov[Model Governance and Audit dashboard]
